{"t":"LCID","made":"2026-11-06 14:38","name":"Lucid Group, Inc.","ko":"루시드","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Auto Manufacturers","employees":9000,"hq":"Newark, CA, United States","website":"https://www.lucidmotors.com","summary_en":"Lucid Group, Inc., a technology company, designs, develops, manufactures, and sells electric vehicles (EV), EV powertrains, and battery systems. The company provides Lucid Air sedan and Lucid Gravity SUV. It also designs and develops proprietary software in-house for Lucid vehicles. The company sells vehicles directly to consumers through its retail sales network and direct online sales, including Lucid Financial Services. The company is headquartered in Newark, California. Lucid Group, Inc. is a subsidiary of Ayar Third Investment Company.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Lucid Group, Inc.는 전기 자동차(EV), EV 파워트레인 및 배터리 시스템을 설계, 개발, 제조 및 판매하는 기술 회사입니다. 이 회사는 Lucid Air 세단과 Lucid Gravity SUV를 제공합니다. 또한 Lucid 차량을 위한 자체 독점 소프트웨어를 설계하고 개발합니다. 이 회사는 소매 판매 네트워크와 Lucid Financial Services를 포함한 직접 온라인 판매를 통해 소비자에게 차량을 직접 판매합니다. 이 회사는 캘리포니아주 뉴어크에 본사를 두고 있습니다. Lucid Group, Inc.는 Ayar Third Investment Company의 자회사입니다.","val":{"price":2.98,"mcap":1174329088.0,"pe":null,"fpe":-0.5936255,"peg":null,"ps":0.759041,"pb":-1.1098697,"ev_ebitda":-1.944,"div":0.0,"beta":0.879,"hi52":18.1,"lo52":2.37},"fin":{"rev":1547122048.0,"rev_g":0.562,"eps_g":null,"gross":-1.00603,"op":-2.61009,"net":-2.49214,"roe":-1.25992,"fcf":-3364247552.0,"cash":761313024.0,"debt":3656666880.0,"de":197.84,"eps":-13.71,"feps":-5.02},"own":{"short":0.6036,"inst":0.68367994,"insider":0.15449001},"analyst":{"n":9,"mean":7.38889,"median":7.0,"high":17.0,"low":3.0,"rec":"none","recMean":null,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":0,"buy":1,"hold":7,"sell":1,"strongSell":2},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":0,"buy":1,"hold":7,"sell":1,"strongSell":2},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":0,"buy":1,"hold":7,"sell":1,"strongSell":2}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-15",